source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A bracket body whose title ends in a backslash renders no link at all; Jira shows the markup as text and the backslash itself is gone.
-- input.jira --
[x|http://x|t\]
-- rendered.html --
<p>[x|http://x|t]</p>
-- want.md --
\[x|http://x|t\]
-- warnings.json --
[]
